 "author": "musho7-dev",
 "date": "2026-11-07T23:08:01+04:00",
 "subject": "Add 24 Kenney Car Kit vehicles, car picture grid, and test coins",
 "body": "- tools/render_kit.gd batch-renders kit vehicles into body + front/back\n  wheel sprites and a collision hull (assets/cars/kit, CC0 by Kenney)\n- Vehicles load from kit.json with stats by type (karts, sports, everyday,\n  trucks, tractors); different front/back wheel sizes supported\n- Garage shows vehicles as a 4-column grid with thumbnails\n- Body hull is clipped above the wheels so low cars ride on their tires\n- Crash signal deferred out of the physics callback\n- TEST_MODE in main.gd tops up to 1,000,000 coins (turn off before release)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
